# URLs that were public and have been removed on the owner's decision, so they no longer answer (404).
# Not published (tools/ is excluded). One row per URL as "<url> <YYYY-MM-DD>", the date of the removal.
# Their rows stay in tools/urls.lock, which is append-only: this list is the record that the removal was
# meant. tools/verify/permanence.js accepts a locked URL with no file only when it is listed here, and fails
# if a URL listed here is not locked, still has a file, is in sitemap.xml or llms.txt, or is linked by a page.
# A URL listed here is never reused. AGENTS.md, "Posts, permanence and withdrawal".
